OL,3,AUkraine says military Starlink
OL,4,Adisrupted again as US envoys meet Putin
OL,5,Ain Moscow
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,8,Fhas said his country's military was
OL,9,Fagain facing "systematic" restrictions
OL,10,Fto Starlink's military-grade service,
OL,11,Fmeaning Kyiv was struggling to
OL,12,Fintercept Russian jet-powered drones.
OL,14,FStarshield is owned by Elon Musk's
OL,15,FSpaceX company and plays a vital role
OL,16,Fin military operations.
OL,18,FUkraine was "trying to clear up all
OL,19,Fcircumstances with the American side",
OL,20,FZelensky said.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
